# Engineering Examples

## Count Python files

```bash
find . -name "*.py" | wc -l
```

Counts the number of Python files in the current directory and its subdirectories.

---

## Count error lines in a log

```bash
grep "ERROR" server.log | wc -l
```

Counts the number of log lines containing the word **ERROR**.

---

## View recent log entries

```bash
tail -20 server.log
```

Displays the last 20 lines of the log file.

---

## View the beginning of a dataset

```bash
head -10 data.csv
```

Shows the first 10 rows of the dataset.

